         e.g. RDI ∈ SysV args but RDI ∉ MSx64 args, and R8/R9 ∈ x86 but
         ∉ AArch64.
      2. NO-FALSE-SysV: the classifier returns SysV only when a SysV-only witness
         (RDI or RSI) was actually observed, or a SysV arg with no MSx64 reason —
